+# Week 15 — Integration and Polish
+
+**Date:** [[DATE: week 15 — TBD, confirm against real CS2 section schedule]]
+
+## Status
+
+Integration/polish week; actual meeting pattern TBD.
+
+## Weekly Focus
+
+No new Deitel chapter. Strengthen project integration, resolve known debt, improve explanation and demonstrability, and prepare searching/sorting work for the final checkpoint.
+
+## Gate-or-checkpoint tie-in
+
+No new chapter-concept gate. Update the World Bible and use feedback from Checkpoint 3 to prepare the Week 16 full-integration pass.
+
+## Due this week
+
+No separate technical assignment beyond Odyssey integration/polish and the current World Bible update; confirm any shared-strand artifacts against the real schedule.
