+# Week 14 — Checkpoint 3: Recursion + Plotting
+
+**Date:** [[DATE: week 14 — TBD, confirm against real CS2 section schedule]]
+
+## Status
+
+Checkpoint week; actual meeting pattern TBD.
+
+## Weekly Focus
+
